2. Purpose & Scope

This document defines the deterministic configuration for Supabase Metrics API integration and the canonical Grafana dashboard for the OMNI-333 architecture. It ensures that all database performance and health telemetry are captured, verified, and visualized according to sovereign governance standards.

3. Supabase Metrics API Overview

Every Supabase project exposes a Prometheus-compatible Metrics API endpoint surfacing ~200 Postgres performance and health series.

Key Capabilities:

Stream database telemetry: CPU, IO, WAL, connection, and query stats into Prometheus-compatible systems.

Unified Observability: Combine Supabase metrics with application signals in Grafana or Datadog.

Alerting Policies: Build policies for right-sizing, saturation detection, and index regression.

